        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 1258864852,
        "heading": "Horticulture",
        "text": "Dipogon lignosus has been widely cultivated outside of South Africa from as far back as the early nineteenth century. Areas where it has been used in horticulture include Europe, Madeira, Azores, Sri Lanka, Australia, California and temperate regions of South America.",
